# A site baseline lists one site per line (tests/site_baseline.py), so it merges as a set of lines
# (scripts/git_sites_merge.py): two branches that each add a site merge without a conflict, a line
# either branch deleted stays deleted, and two branches that each change one site's line stop as a
# conflict. `npm run hooks:install` configures the driver; a clone without it merges as text.
*.sites.jsonl merge=sites-set
